ecessary, making this the first true generator on the Internet. It uses a dictionary of over 200 Latin words, combined with a handful of model sentence structures, to generate Lorem Ipsum which looks reasonable. The generated Lorem Ipsum is therefore always free from repetition, injected humour, or non-characteristic words etc.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p>","author":"Anne Rice","genre":"Mystery","is_active":1,"cover_image":"cover_images/96Ke4IvOwDpUZdUnAaYv2rP8vEVWc3cbZarN1dtr.png","read_count":4,"comment_count":0,"likes_count":0,"style":null,"status":"pending","created_at":"2025-05-16T18:56:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T22:16:22.000000Z","is_community":0,"published_to_community_at":null,"created_at_formatted":"16 May 2025"}]} 
